    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/b513da573c570651b41c9adb1e6f7d06.poster.avif?t=1749285944\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/b513da573c570651b41c9adb1e6f7d06.webm?t=1749285944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/b513da573c570651b41c9adb1e6f7d06.mp4?t=1749285944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering Blade Blitz is a breeze with intuitive controls. A joystick and two buttons are all you need to start slicing and dicing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/a5ab2a7986915b71eca7cbf0b5bf7e93.poster.avif?t=1749285944\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/a5ab2a7986915b71eca7cbf0b5bf7e93.webm?t=1749285944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/a5ab2a7986915b71eca7cbf0b5bf7e93.mp4?t=1749285944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Couch Competitive Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blade Blitz is a frenzy for up to six players, perfect for local multiplayer fun with friends. Enjoy short, sharp rounds of chaotic action. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/4f64a7435930189907d59f1135283a70.poster.avif?t=1749285944\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/4f64a7435930189907d59f1135283a70.webm?t=1749285944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/4f64a7435930189907d59f1135283a70.mp4?t=1749285944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arenas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle it out in unique arenas, each offering its own edge-of-your-seat challenges.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/a91c54ad0082096d1be7447ce535a2bf.poster.avif?t=1749285944\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/a91c54ad0082096d1be7447ce535a2bf.webm?t=1749285944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/a91c54ad0082096d1be7447ce535a2bf.mp4?t=1749285944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join Forces</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a friend in 1v1 to 3v3 team battles. Or, if you prefer a solo adventure, test your blade against AI opponents. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Notes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your Blade Blitz experience by toggling Friendly Fire on or off.\u00a0 We support a wide range of controllers, including Xbox, PlayStation, Switch, and many more.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/b513da573c570651b41c9adb1e6f7d06.poster.avif?t=1749285944\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/b513da573c570651b41c9adb1e6f7d06.webm?t=1749285944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/b513da573c570651b41c9adb1e6f7d06.mp4?t=1749285944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering Blade Blitz is a breeze with intuitive controls. A joystick and two buttons are all you need to start slicing and dicing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/a5ab2a7986915b71eca7cbf0b5bf7e93.poster.avif?t=1749285944\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/a5ab2a7986915b71eca7cbf0b5bf7e93.webm?t=1749285944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/a5ab2a7986915b71eca7cbf0b5bf7e93.mp4?t=1749285944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Couch Competitive Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blade Blitz is a frenzy for up to six players, perfect for local multiplayer fun with friends. Enjoy short, sharp rounds of chaotic action. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/4f64a7435930189907d59f1135283a70.poster.avif?t=1749285944\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/4f64a7435930189907d59f1135283a70.webm?t=1749285944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/4f64a7435930189907d59f1135283a70.mp4?t=1749285944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arenas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle it out in unique arenas, each offering its own edge-of-your-seat challenges.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/a91c54ad0082096d1be7447ce535a2bf.poster.avif?t=1749285944\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/a91c54ad0082096d1be7447ce535a2bf.webm?t=1749285944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/a91c54ad0082096d1be7447ce535a2bf.mp4?t=1749285944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join Forces</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a friend in 1v1 to 3v3 team battles. Or, if you prefer a solo adventure, test your blade against AI opponents. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Notes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your Blade Blitz experience by toggling Friendly Fire on or off.\u00a0 We support a wide range of controllers, including Xbox, PlayStation, Switch, and many more.</p>",
    "short_description": "Blade Blitz is a casual, yet competitive, local multiplayer game to play with your friends. Simply spin, slice, and poke your way through the opponents in a tug-of-war push to score the points for your team. Power ups provide tense matches, evening the odds as each team closes in on victory.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cI would absolutely recommend Blade Blitz to any player who enjoys gaming with their friends in this amazing couch co-op experience. As a bonus, Blade Blitz is also single-player friendly. So, if you\u2019re looking to get a couple of warm-up rounds in before your friends come over, you can challenge the game\u2019s AI in the same game modes you\u2019d experience with friends.\u201d<br>Game Raven Review<br>",
